Bundled journal and publisher artwork

Retrieved 2026-11-16. The three PNG files preserve the complete source artwork,
its aspect ratio, and transparency. No letters, symbols or registration marks
are removed; no shape is redrawn or recomposed, and no white canvas is added.
Only fully transparent outer margins are trimmed. Network access is not needed.
A journal mark is shown only for its exact journal (ISSN, else title). A
publisher mark is shown only for a record that names no journal or venue and
whose publisher is exactly that publisher; a journal from that publisher gets
its generated letter mark instead. Owner approval of each mark's appearance:
pending the contact sheet of 2026-11-17.

